msgid "--Let's Chat with Minori!--"
msgstr "--¡Charlemos con Minori!--"

msgid "Minori「Whoa! Do you require a one-liner,＿perhaps!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Vaya! ¡¿Acaso necesitas＿un chiste rápido?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why would you think that!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Por qué pensarías eso?!」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, do I reek of natto? I had a side dish＿of natto with my lunch. My bad, bro!」"
msgstr "Minori「Ah, ¿apesto a natto?＿Lo comí de guarnición＿al almorzar. ¡Perdón, hermano!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Look, it's not the natto............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mira, no es el natto............」"

msgid "Minori「It's not the natto?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿No es el natto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, it's............ *Sigh* Never mind.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, es............ *Suspiro* No importa.」"

msgid "Minori「What is it? Something important?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué pasa? ¿Algo importante?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, uh, nothing important, no.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, eh, nada importante, no.」"

msgid "Minori「Whoa, Takasu-kun, that's the spirit!＿You're like some kind of elite A-rank＿sniper and I'm the target!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Vaya, Takasu-kun, ese es el espíritu!＿¡Eres como un francotirador de élite＿rango A y yo el blanco!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't you stand behind me...... Wait, I＿walked right into that!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te pongas detrás de mí...... ¡Espera,＿caí directo en la trampa!」"

msgid "Minori「Ahahaha! I appreciate you playing＿along with my joke!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ajajaja! ¡Agradezco que me sigas＿el juego con mi broma!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I'm happy to be of service, then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Me alegra ser útil, entonces.」"

msgid "Minori「Whoa, talk about a Kodak moment!＿Click, zoom, snap!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Vaya, todo un momento Kodak!＿¡Clic, zoom, foto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Never mind, never mind!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No importa, no importa!」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun, listen......」"
msgstr "Minori「Takasu-kun, escucha......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Hm?」"

msgid "Minori「No, never mind.」"
msgstr "Minori「No, olvídalo.」"

msgid "Minori「Oho, I've never seen you make that＿face.」"
msgstr "Minori「Vaya, nunca te había visto＿poner esa cara.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What do you mean?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿A qué te refieres?」"

msgid "Minori「Hehe!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jeje!」"

msgid "Minori「Do you...... wanna swim? It's a real＿shame, since we're at Luxure and all......」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Tienes...... ganas de nadar? Es una＿lástima, estando en Luxure y todo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nah, I'm satisfied just being able to＿take a load off.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nah, me conformo con poder＿descansar un rato.」"

msgid "Minori「Do you...... still feel sick?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Todavía...... te sientes mal?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, that's not it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no es eso.」"

msgid "Minori「Hm～～ You don't look pale. Looks like＿there's no need to worry about your＿health any more.」"
msgstr "Minori「Hm～～ No te ves pálido. Parece＿que ya no hay razón para preocuparse＿por tu salud.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. I'm just playing it safe by taking＿it easy today.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Solo voy a lo seguro tomándomelo＿con calma hoy.」"

msgid "Minori「It seems the time has come to settle＿the glaring contest.」"
msgstr "Minori「Parece que ha llegado la hora de＿resolver el duelo de miradas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Couldn't ask for more...... Yeah, right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No podría pedir más...... Sí, claro.」"

msgid "Minori「Awww.」"
msgstr "Minori「Aaaah.」"

msgid "Minori「Yeah, that! I'm so curious～～! I wonder＿how much faster it makes you!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sí, eso! ¡Qué curiosidad～～! ¡Me＿pregunto cuánto más rápido te hace ir!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda, I bet you're the type to want＿to try it on.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kushieda, apuesto a que eres de＿las que querrían probárselo.」"

msgid "Minori「That's right! Gosh～ You got me!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Así es! ¡Caramba～ Me descubriste!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why are you blushing about it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué te sonrojas por eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I-It's impossible NOT to picture it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡E-Es imposible NO imaginárselo!」"

msgid "Minori「STOOOP! It's so embarrassing! NOOO!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡BASTAAA! ¡Qué vergüenza! ¡NOOO!」"

msgid "Minori「Apparently they're CRAZY expensive.＿Not exactly an impulse buy.」"
msgstr "Minori「Por lo visto son CARÍSIMOS. No＿son precisamente un capricho.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I see...... Out of your league, eh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... Fuera de tu alcance, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Minori「It is the east, and I am the sun!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Es el oriente, y yo soy el sol!」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, I was wondering about that too. I＿wonder what it's like?」"
msgstr "Minori「Ah, yo también me preguntaba＿eso. ¿Cómo se sentirá?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What IS it like? I wish we could get＿someone to find out for us.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cómo SE sentirá? Ojalá pudiéramos＿hacer que alguien lo averigüe.」"

msgid "Minori「Whether you're a girl or a boy, being＿seen in that kinda thing is no fun.」"
msgstr "Minori「Seas chica o chico, que te vean con＿algo así no es nada divertido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「R-Really?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿E-En serio?」"

msgid "Minori「Really!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡En serio!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I wasn't trying to imply anything, but＿I apologize for spoiling your mood.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No intentaba insinuar nada, pero＿perdón por arruinarte el humor.」"

msgid "Minori「RAAAAAARGH! HATE SPEEEEECH!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡RAAAAAARGH! ¡DISCURSO DE ODIOOOOO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Hate speech!? Wha? Uhh, err,＿sorry!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¡¿Discurso de odio?!＿¿Qué? Ehh, ehm, ¡perdón!」"

msgid "Minori「Hmph!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jum!」"

msgid "Minori「I wanted to wear trunks, too.」"
msgstr "Minori「También quería usar pantalón de baño.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué?!」"

msgid "Minori「Just kidding.」"
msgstr "Minori「Era broma.」"

msgid "Minori「Yeah, it sure is tough being a diet＿warrior...... Exhausting......」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí, vaya que es duro ser una guerrera＿de la dieta...... Agotador......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, I'm talking about me here, not＿you......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, estoy hablando de mí, no de ti......」"

msgid "Minori「Don't remind me......」"
msgstr "Minori「No me lo recuerdes......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I said I didn't mean you!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡Dije que no hablaba de ti!!」"

msgid "Minori「OOOOOH!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡OOOOOH!」"

msgid "Minori「SHUT UP! Never, ever say that!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡CÁLLATE! ¡Nunca, jamás digas eso!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I'm sorry!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oh, lo siento!」"

msgid "Minori「Fufu!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Juju!」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, a variety, huh? What \"variety\"＿would that be?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Ah, varias, eh? ¿Qué clase＿de \"varias\" serían esas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, basically...... Nah, let's not go＿there.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, básicamente...... Nah,＿mejor no entremos en eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura's team, huh...... Could be fun,＿or horrible. It's a toss-up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「El equipo de Kitamura...... Puede ser＿divertido u horrible. Es puro azar.」"

msgid "Minori「It is Kitamura-kun, after all!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Es Kitamura-kun, después de todo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yep, it's Kitamura......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, es Kitamura......」"

msgid "Minori「See, it's embarrassing, but the＿Captains work hard too, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「Mira, da vergüenza, pero los capitanes＿también trabajan duro, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Come to think of it...... I suppose so.＿Gotta set an example.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora que lo pienso...... Supongo＿que sí. Hay que dar el ejemplo.」"

msgid "Minori「Aww, shucks, you're making me blush.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ay, caramba, me haces sonrojar.」"

msgid "Minori「Of course! Haven't you ever wanted to＿join a club or anything? You've got the＿height for it.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Claro! ¿Nunca has querido unirte＿a un club o algo? Tienes la＿estatura para eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Really? I thought I was average.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio? Pensé que era promedio.」"

msgid "Minori「No, really～ The ideal is like 170ish.」"
msgstr "Minori「No, de verdad～ Lo ideal es como 1.70.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ideal, huh...... Well, 170cm is tall for a＿girl, I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ideal, eh...... Bueno, 170 cm es＿alto para una chica, supongo.」"

msgid "Minori「Really? I don't think so～」"
msgstr "Minori「¿En serio? Yo no lo creo～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I really mean it. Your form is, um......＿beautiful.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo digo en serio. Tu técnica＿es, ehm...... hermosa.」"

msgid "Minori「Why thank you!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Pues muchas gracias!」"

msgid "Minori「Aww, you're just saying that.」"
msgstr "Minori「Bah, solo lo dices por decir.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I really mean it......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, lo digo de verdad......」"

msgid "Minori「I do love to swim. Well, I'm a sports fan＿in general, see.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí que me encanta nadar. Bueno, soy fan＿de los deportes en general, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I can kinda tell.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, más o menos se nota.」"

msgid "Minori「Ahaha! I give off that impression, don't＿I?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ajaja! Doy esa impresión, ¿no?」"

msgid "Minori「Fu fu fu...... Truth is, I was a mermaid in＿my past life! Don't tell anyone, bud!」"
msgstr "Minori「Jujuju...... ¡De verdad, fui＿sirena en mi vida pasada! ¡No＿lo cuentes, amigo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Okay. But a mermaid, though?＿What's wrong with a fish......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Está bien. ¿Pero una sirena? ¿Qué＿tiene de malo un pez......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「My heart!? Oh god, please spare me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Mi corazón?! Ay Dios, ten piedad.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You really do love your sports, huh.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「De verdad te encantan los deportes, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Ehehe! You know how it is!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ejeje! ¡Ya sabes cómo es!」"

msgid "Minori「Oh really? If I'd known that, I would＿have invited you to one of＿Kitamura-kun's games.」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Ah, en serio? De haberlo sabido,＿te habría invitado a un partido＿de Kitamura-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah? Well, could you give me a＿heads up next time?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ah, sí? Bueno, ¿podrías avisarme＿la próxima vez?」"

msgid "Minori「Roger that!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Entendido!」"

msgid "Minori「I love it, bud! I like playing sports too,＿though!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Me encanta, amigo! ¡Aunque también＿me gusta practicar deportes!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I could already kinda tell.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso ya más o menos se notaba.」"

msgid "Minori「Hehe!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jeje!」"

msgid "Minori「Whoa there, Takasu-kun, retiring so＿soon!? Amin's pranks are customized＿for your enjoyment! So enjoy it, boy!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Alto ahí, Takasu-kun! ¿Te retiras＿tan pronto? ¡Las bromas de Amin＿son para tu disfrute!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She's got me wrapped around her＿finger......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me tiene comiendo de la＿palma de su mano......」"

msgid "Minori「Amin's mature, that's why. She＿surprises me too.」"
msgstr "Minori「Amin es madura, por eso. A＿mí también me sorprende.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Mature......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Madura......?」"

msgid "Minori「But what Amin says...... is always right.」"
msgstr "Minori「Pero Amin...... siempre tiene razón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Really......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿De verdad......?」"

msgid "Minori「Oho! Like what?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Vaya! ¿Como qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, in a lot of ways. When she opens＿up, there's no end to it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, en muchos sentidos. Cuando＿se abre, no tiene fin.」"

msgid "Minori「Well, I'll admit she can really get your＿pound hearting～」"
msgstr "Minori「Bueno, admito que puede hacer que＿te dé un corazón el vuelco～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, that is not how I meant it......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no lo decía en ese sentido......」"

msgid "Minori「So what you're saying is...... Looking at＿Amin in her swimsuit gives you dirty＿thoughts, am I right?」"
msgstr "Minori「O sea que dices...... ¿ver a＿Amin en traje de baño te da malos＿pensamientos, verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're wrong!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡Te equivocas!!」"

msgid "Minori「So what you're saying is...!! Amin in her＿swimsuit... in her swimsuit...!! OH,＿YOUUUTH!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡O sea que dices...!! ¡¡Amin en traje＿de baño...!! ¡¡OH, JUVENTUUUD!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-You got it all wrong!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡L-Lo entendiste todo mal!!」"

msgid "Minori「When I see Amin in her swimsuit, I＿can't believe we're part of the same＿species......」"
msgstr "Minori「Cuando veo a Amin en traje de＿baño, no creo que seamos de＿la misma especie......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「B-But you still...... look......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Pero tú...... también te ves......」"

msgid "Minori「What?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nothing......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nada......」"

msgid "Minori「Hmm......」"
msgstr "Minori「Mmm......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hm? What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Hm? ¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I didn't mean any harm by it. I just＿noticed one recently with her on the＿cover.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No lo decía con mala intención.＿Solo vi una hace poco con ella＿en la portada.」"

msgid "Minori「That's good then...... Sorry, I read too＿much into it. Forget it.」"
msgstr "Minori「Qué bueno entonces...... Perdón,＿lo malinterpreté. Olvídalo.」"

msgid "Minori「I've seen 'em, but haven't bought any.＿Magazines are pretty expensive, see......」"
msgstr "Minori「Las he visto, pero no compré＿ninguna. Las revistas son muy＿caras, ya ves......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Expensive indeed.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Muy caras, sin duda.」"

msgid "Minori「Of course! OFF course! Cartwheel!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Por supuesto, por su puesto, voltereta!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Cartwheel?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Voltereta?」"

msgid "Minori「I have. She was posing all like......＿Whoops, I could show you but I'd have＿to charge.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí. Estaba posando así como......＿Uy, podría mostrártelo, pero＿tendría que cobrarte.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha--!? It can't have been that explicit!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué--?! ¡No pudo ser tan explícita!」"

msgid "Minori「Fufufu, that's what you think!」"
msgstr "Minori「Jujuju, ¡eso es lo que tú crees!」"

msgid "Minori「EXAAACTLY! Talking together and＿bonding is the BEST way to revel in＿our youth!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡EXAAACTO! ¡Charlar y estrechar＿lazos es la MEJOR forma de disfrutar＿la juventud!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, right! But could you keep your＿voice down, please? Literally everyone＿is staring at us.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, claro! Pero baja la voz,＿por favor. Todo el mundo se nos＿está quedando mirando.」"

msgid "Minori「Say what? The mighty sun laughs at＿your worries!」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Cómo dices? ¡El poderoso sol se＿ríe de tus preocupaciones!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Ya veo......」"

msgid "Minori「True that! Whenever I see Haruta-kun＿acting a fool, I think to myself, \"I could＿do better!\"」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Tal cual! Cada vez que veo a Haruta-kun＿haciendo el tonto, pienso: \"¡Yo＿lo haría mejor!\"」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't worry, uh, you're doing just fine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tranquila, eh, lo estás haciendo bien.」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun, your comebacks are as＿strong as ever.」"
msgstr "Minori「Takasu-kun, tus respuestas son＿tan agudas como siempre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Really?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿De verdad?」"

msgid "Minori「Really!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡En serio!」"

msgid "Minori「That's our Takasu-kun! Your mind is＿always on everyone else, isn't it!? We＿are eternally obliged! Hah!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ese es nuestro Takasu-kun! ¡Siempre＿piensas en los demás, ¿no?! ¡Estamos＿agradecidos! ¡Ja!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I'm just wondering, that's all......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, solo tenía curiosidad, es todo......」"

msgid "Minori「Amin and her friends are covered in......＿Oh jeez, I nearly went and said it!」"
msgstr "Minori「Amin y sus amigas están cubiertas＿de...... ¡Ay cielos, casi lo suelto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What was it......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué era......?」"

msgid "Minori「Not telling! Can't say!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No te digo! ¡No se puede contar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That was... suggestive...」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso sonó... sugestivo...」"

msgid "Minori「Taiga's on the fourth floor. I wanted to＿swim with her, but she turned me＿down, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「Taiga está en el cuarto piso. Quería＿nadar con ella, pero me rechazó, amigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't you think Taiga just wanted you＿to have fun swimming without＿worrying about her?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No crees que Taiga solo quería＿que te divirtieras nadando sin＿preocuparte por ella?」"

msgid "Minori「Yeah. That's probably it.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí. Seguramente es eso.」"

msgid "Minori「Taiga said she's gonna hang out on the＿fourth floor.」"
msgstr "Minori「Taiga dijo que se va a quedar＿por el cuarto piso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see. What about Kawashima and her＿friends?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo. ¿Y qué hay de Kawashima＿y sus amigas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Aromatherapy massages? That＿sounds practically made for them.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Masajes de aromaterapia? Eso suena＿prácticamente hecho para ellas.」"

msgid "Minori「So you think of it like that too? I＿happen to like her.」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Así que tú también lo ves así?＿A mí me cae bastante bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, I don't exactly hate her myself.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, yo tampoco es que la odie.」"

msgid "Minori「Since we came all this way, I wanted＿her to do underwater aerobics with＿us......」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya que vinimos hasta acá, quería＿que hiciera aeróbicos acuáticos＿con nosotros......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Underwater aerobics......? Well, as long＿as she's happy relaxing to her heart's＿content, it's not a big deal, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Aeróbicos acuáticos......? Mientras＿sea feliz relajándose a gusto,＿no es gran cosa, ¿no?」"

msgid "Minori「You're right.」"
msgstr "Minori「Tienes razón.」"

msgid "Minori「It was a total stroke of fate, huh?」"
msgstr "Minori「Fue todo un golpe del destino, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That it was.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vaya que sí.」"

msgid "Minori「What do you think she's up to right＿now?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué crees que esté haciendo＿ahora mismo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Probably relaxing...... Wait, what weird＿ideas are you getting?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Seguramente relajándose......＿Espera, ¿qué ideas raras se＿te están ocurriendo?」"

msgid "Minori「Teeheehee......」"
msgstr "Minori「Jijiji......」"

msgid "Minori「Yours totally could! Teach it to jump or＿something!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡El tuyo seguro que sí! ¡¡Enséñale＿a saltar o algo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh, it can FLY.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehh, puede VOLAR.」"

msgid "Minori「Truth is, last time around I secretly......＿Hehehe!」"
msgstr "Minori「La verdad, la última vez a＿escondidas...... ¡Jejeje!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What did you do?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué hiciste?」"

msgid "Minori「Hehehe!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jejeje!」"

msgid "Minori「It's cruel to try and force it, you know?」"
msgstr "Minori「Es cruel intentar obligarlo, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I won't force it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No lo voy a obligar!」"

msgid "Minori「Inko-chan is funny, with or without any＿tricks!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Inko-chan es gracioso,＿con o sin trucos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's true.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso es cierto.」"

msgid "Minori「Hang on, Takasu-kun! I, Kushieda＿Minori, am not so cowardly as to fret＿over such trifles!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Espera, Takasu-kun! ¡Yo, Kushieda＿Minori, no soy tan cobarde como para＿afligirme por nimiedades!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? B-But......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? P-Pero......」"

msgid "Minori「If you scold Inko-chan any further......＿I'mma get mad!」"
msgstr "Minori「Si sigues regañando a Inko-chan......＿¡me voy a enojar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Okay, understood......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Está bien, entendido......」"

msgid "Minori「Surely you didn't make Inko-chan＿suffer domestic violence because of＿it!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿No habrás hecho que Inko-chan sufra＿violencia doméstica por eso?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No! Absolutely not!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No! ¡Para nada!」"

msgid "Minori「If you scold Inko-chan any further, I＿won't forgive you!」"
msgstr "Minori「Si sigues regañando a Inko-chan,＿¡no te lo perdonaré!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien......」"

msgid "Minori「No more worrying about it. And please＿don't scold Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya no te preocupes por eso. Y por＿favor no regañes a Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah? Alright. But I really am sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Sí? Bien. Pero de verdad lo siento.」"

msgid "Minori「It's okay. Don't sweat it.」"
msgstr "Minori「No pasa nada. Ni te preocupes.」"

msgid "Minori「No matter the animal, it won't live as＿long as a human......」"
msgstr "Minori「Sea el animal que sea, no vivirá＿tanto como un humano......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, you're right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, tienes razón.」"

msgid "Minori「Parting is such sweet sorrow......」"
msgstr "Minori「La despedida es tan dulce pena......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah...... But the moment we decided to＿adopt it, we had to be prepared for the＿inevitable outcome......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí...... Pero al decidir adoptarlo,＿debíamos prepararnos para el desenlace＿inevitable......」"

msgid "Minori「Yeah.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí.」"

msgid "Minori「I'm not sure, but I think Inko-chan will＿live longer than you'd expect!」"
msgstr "Minori「No estoy segura, ¡pero creo que＿Inko-chan vivirá más de lo que esperas!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You think so?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tú crees?」"

msgid "Minori「Yep. I just have a feeling.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sip. Solo tengo un presentimiento.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmm... Well, it's certainly a little...＿different.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hmm... Bueno, sin duda es＿un poco... diferente.」"

msgid "Minori「In Inko-chan's case, it'll outlive even＿you!」"
msgstr "Minori「En el caso de Inko-chan, ¡vivirá＿incluso más que tú!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In that case, I won't have anyone to＿entrust its care to, so I can't die......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces no tendré a quién＿confiarle su cuidado, así que＿no puedo morir......」"

msgid "Minori「I was kidding!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Era broma!」"

