msgid "Minori「The whole-body ones are crazy＿constricting. Even if you have＿someone helping you, they take like」"
msgstr "Minori「Los de cuerpo completo＿aprietan muchísimo. Incluso si＿alguien te ayuda, tardas como」"

msgid "Minori「half an hour to put on.」"
msgstr "Minori「media hora en ponértelos.」"

msgid "Minori「Wellll, even around other girls, being＿butt naked for so long is just...... Wait!＿HEY! Don't you start blushing too!」"
msgstr "Minori「Bueeeno, hasta entre chicas, estar＿desnuda tanto rato es...... ¡Espera!＿¡EY! ¡No te sonrojes!」"

msgid "Minori「Don't try to picture it!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡No intentes imaginártelo!」"

msgid "Minori「Softball? Oh yeah～～ It's so fun! You＿should join the boys' team!＿Kitamura-kun would be happy to have」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Sóftbol? ¡Sí～～ Es muy divertido!＿¡Únete al equipo! A Kitamura-kun＿le encantaría contar」"

msgid "Minori「you.」"
msgstr "Minori「contigo.」"

msgid "Minori「Ohh, how exquisite! In that case, you＿should go watch Kitamura-kun's next＿game! Kitamura-kun's so cool～! He」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ohh, qué exquisito! ¡En ese caso,＿ve el próximo partido de Kitamura-kun!＿¡Es tan genial～! ¡Él」"

msgid "Minori「could steal your heart!」"
msgstr "Minori「podría robarte el corazón!」"

msgid "Minori「Watching sports is great. Seeing it in＿person makes you feel more＿connected...... Whoa there, at this rate」"
msgstr "Minori「Ver deportes es genial. Verlos＿en persona te conecta más......＿Uy, a este ritmo」"

msgid "Minori「I'll never shut up. Three strikes, I'm＿out!」"
msgstr "Minori「no me callaré nunca. ¡Tres＿strikes, estoy fuera!」"

msgid "Minori「Uhh, well...... Just now, about Amin,＿umm...... No, I know you're not the kind＿of person who would say something」"
msgstr "Minori「Ehh, bueno...... Lo de Amin,＿ehm...... No, sé que no eres＿de los que dirían algo」"

msgid "Minori「like that.」"
msgstr "Minori「así.」"

msgid "Minori「Amin and the others said they were＿going to the lounge on the fifth floor.＿They wanted aromatherapy massages,」"
msgstr "Minori「Amin y las demás iban al salón＿del quinto piso. Querían masajes＿de aromaterapia,」"

msgid "Minori「see.」"
msgstr "Minori「¿ves?」"
